  "description": "Answers as if the documentation the payer asked for had been accepted, whether or not the request carries any: the request is certified in total. PAS 2.0.1 fixes a documentation request's status to active, so acceptance shows as a later decision, not as a closed request. It is in the shape PAS 2.0.1 gives.",
